.25,"calibratedP":0.24365781951176513,"calibratedSource":"stored","rationale":"Account is 6 days old, first project reached day 1 [email:468c6e0f], but no invites sent and no replies to either outreach [email:78d0f963] despite a held onboarding call [calendar:49ca9705]. Engagement has gone quiet with 8 days left and no tickets, suggesting modest unaided odds.","draft":{"from":"priya@wrenfield.test","to":"hana@silvergroup.test","subject":"Following up on your first project","body":"Hi Hana,\n\nThanks again for making time for the getting started call last week. Since you've got your first project set up, the natural next step is bringing your team in alongside you -- projects are the main organizing unit, and tasks live inside them, so it helps to have the people doing the work in there too. A teammate can be invited from Account Settings -> Members at any time, and teammates can be bulk-invited from a CSV file instead of one at a time.\n\nWould a short call this week help? Happy to walk through it with you.\n\nBest,\nPriya"},"actionId":"91306296-e65d-4254-88a0-64eb2ecfe535","evidenceRefs":["a4a48329-0566-40df-a1db-49daff379b10","3d9c5201-fe88-42d4-8733-ffe20afbd883","7ef26da8-0f53-4c9f-92cf-2b8d2c712d2b","a251349d-d6fc-4ff6-b231-da8fd797f991","93b07fda-6504-413c-a24b-f6bb07868399","c40a6a81-3427-4273-a41e-bd98c8f4ab1d"],"refs":{"email:78d0f963":"a251349d-d6fc-4ff6-b231-da8fd797f991","slack:af1b8360":"594a2ff3-2528-4292-b700-40ced7bee099","slack:709fb7f3":"c17ad629-c0f7-4e68-b427-7d57a496715d","calendar:49ca9705":"c40a6a81-3427-4273-a41e-bd98c8f4ab1d","email:468c6e0f":"93b07fda-6504-413c-a24b-f6bb07868399"},"flags":[],"modelId":"claude-opus-5","promptVersion":"draft-v2@19f89f34/effort-medium","costUsd":0.0109725,"trigger":[]}],"outcome":{"outcome":0,"resolvedAt":"2026-08-22T06:46:53.990Z","day":14}}
